<title>JAPAN: Tokyo prosecutors holding briefing Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Tokyo prosecutors holding briefing Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo Prosecutors Office said on Wednesday it is holding a news conference which started at 9.15 a.m. (0015 GMT). It did not say what the briefing was about.</p>
<p>Earlier on Wednesday, NHK Television reported that prosecutors were searching the headquarters of Yamaichi Securities Co Ltd on suspicion of its involvement in the racketeer payoff scandal.</p>
